{"id":"469","t":{"th":null,"ro":"Karin","en":"Karin: Chibi Vampire","na":"かりん"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx469-8v2Am0gCrwvH.png","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx469-8v2Am0gCrwvH.png","color":"#f1c9a1","banner":null,"fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":24,"dur":23,"season":"FALL","year":2005,"start":"2005-11-03","country":"JP","genres":["Comedy","Romance","Supernatural"],"score":67,"pop":27971,"studio":"J.C.STAFF","desc":"Maaka Karin comes from a family of vampires living in Japan, but she is not a normal vampire. Vampires are normally supposed to drink the blood of their victims but Karin suffers from a condition that causes her body to produce excessive amounts of blood. About once a month, she has to get rid of the excess blood by giving it to her \"victims.\" But she somehow manages to go to school like everyone else her age.\n\nWell, things are about to get more complicated. When a new student, Usui Kenta transfers into Karin's class, she starts producing unusually huge amounts of blood, almost as if in reaction to him. Worse, he happens upon Karin's true nature...","descTh":"Maaka Karin comes from a family of vampires living in Japan, but she is not a normal vampire. โดยปกติแล้วแวมไพร์ควรจะดื่มเลือดของเหยื่อ แต่คารินต้องทนทุกข์ทรมานจากอาการที่ทำให้ร่างกายของเธอผลิตเลือดมากเกินไป About once a month, she has to get rid of the excess blood by giving it to her \"victims.\" But she somehow manages to go to school like everyone else her age.\n\nสิ่งต่าง ๆ กำลังจะซับซ้อนมากขึ้น เมื่อนักเรียนใหม่ อุซุย เคนตะ ย้ายเข้าชั้นเรียนของคาริน เธอเริ่มผลิตเลือดจำนวนมหาศาลผิดปกติ เกือบจะราวกับมีปฏิกิริยาต่อเขา ที่แย่กว่านั้นคือเขาบังเอิญพบกับธรรมชาติที่แท้จริงของคาริน...","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":null,"descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":null,"al":"https://anilist.co/anime/469","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/469","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"bilibili","r":"TH","u":"https://www.bil